T2  - RESEARCH JOURNAL OF PHARMACEUTICAL BIOLOGICAL AND CHEMICAL SCIENCES
AB  - The article discusses the development of innovative remote monitoring methods for growing sheep breed Manych merino. The results of the assessment of nutritional value and amino acid grazing in combination with the remote assessment of the NDVI vegetation index are given. It is shown that the introduction of innovative remote monitoring methods allows to optimize production processes when growing the intensive genotype of sheep and to increase the average daily gains of young stock by 7-8% when kept on various pasture plots.
